OL,3,GNEWSAMan found dead at property named
OL,4,Aby family
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man found dead with "multiple
OL,7,Finjuries" at a property in Barnsley has
OL,8,Fbeen named by his family as Russell
OL,9,FBaxter.
OL,11,FPolice were called by the ambulance
OL,12,Fservice to Wingfield Road at about
OL,13,F21:15 BST on Thursday and found the
OL,14,F41-year-old, who was pronounced dead at
OL,15,Fthe scene.
OL,17,FA post-mortem examination carried out
OL,18,Fon Friday produced an "inconclusive
OL,19,Fresult", South Yorkshire Police said,
OL,20,Fwith further testing required to
OL,21,Fdetermine his cause of death.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
